  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dutch Risk Reduction Team (DRR Team) &#x2013; Phase 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Dutch Risk Reduction Team (DRR Team), with a swift response team of experts, advises governments on how to resolve urgent water issues related to flood risks, water pollution and water supply, to prevent disasters or to rebuild after water related disasters.DRR Team advises governments on how to resolve urgent water issues related to flood risks, water pollution and water supply, to prevent disasters or to rebuild after water related disasters.The Netherlands Enterprise Agency (RVO) administers DRR at the request of the Netherlands Ministry of Foreign Affairs and the Netherlands Ministry of Infrastructure and the Environment.For more information: Dutch Disaster Risk Reduction and Surge Support (on english.rvo.nl)Url = https://english.rvo.nl/subsidies-financing/drrs</narrative>
  </description>
